@FnD.Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@FnD.Cloud.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107

### 1. Execute Sync via Gateway
POST {{FnD.Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/sync/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: TENANT_STORE_DELHI_01

[
  {
    "localOrderId": 101,
    "orderDate": "2026-06-01T16:00:00Z",
    "totalAmount": 500.00,
    "items": [
      {
        "productId": 1,
        "quantity": 2,
        "unitPrice": 250.00
      }
    ]
  }
]

###

### 2. Verify Data State Immediately with the AI Text-to-SQL Engine
POST {{FnD.Cloud.API_HostAddress}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the total value of order number 101, and how many items were processed?"
}

###

### 3. Fetch Structured Operational Dashboard Performance Metrics
GET {{FnD.Cloud.API_HostAddress}}/api/reports/dashboard
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: TENANT_STORE_DELHI_01